#SplittySpring 🌸
Dates April 3-7 

Nature’s source of renewal is endless. 

Despite the ugly politics and the never ending pandemic, this is a season where we can easily feel the warmth of the sun on our skin and the hope of new growth. 

Let's allow ourselves to experience the spring together by sharing our yoga practices during this 5 days challenge! 🌸

