✔️Follow all the hosts and sponsors
✔️Repost the flyer with the caption
✔️Tag at least two friends to join you
✔️Post a photo/video daily using #SplittySpring and tag/mention all hosts and sponsors
✔️Show your other challenge participants some love
✔️Keep your profile public #repostandroid #repostw10
